   "source": [
    "# Data Analysis and Validation — Online Shop 2024\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Introduction\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.1 Project Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "Analyze an e-commerce dataset using data profiling, validation, and cleaning techniques with Python and Pandas in order to identify structural characteristics, as well as data quality and integrity issues, before the data is used in subsequent transformation, modeling, and SQL analysis processes.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.2 Technologies Used\n",
    "\n",
    "* Python\n",
    "* Pandas\n",
    "* PostgreSQL\n",
    "* Jupyter Notebook\n",
    "* Visual Studio Code\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Data Loading and Preparation\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.1 Library Import\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "0f990195",
   "metadata": {},
