    "### 6.5 Observations\n",
    "\n",
    "* No orphan records were identified in any of the foreign key relationships (`orphan_records = 0`).\n",
    "* All foreign key values have a corresponding value in their respective parent primary key.\n",
    "* The `order_items.product_id` column contains 1,997 distinct values, while the `products` table contains 2,000 products. This indicates that not all available products have associated records in `order_items`.\n",
    "* The `reviews.product_id` and `reviews.customer_id` columns contain fewer distinct values than the total number of available products and customers, indicating that only a portion of the products and customers have associated review records.\n",
    "* All eight evaluated relationships maintain referential integrity.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.6 Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "The foreign key validation confirms that the relationships defined in the data model maintain referential integrity. No orphan records were identified, and all evaluated foreign key values have corresponding records in their respective parent tables.\n",
