   "source": [
    "### 8.4 Observations\n",
    "\n",
    "* The IQR analysis identified potential outliers only in the `orders.total_price` attribute.\n",
    "* A total of 111 potentially outlying records were identified in `orders.total_price`.\n",
    "* The calculated upper bound for `orders.total_price` was approximately 9,224.18.\n",
    "* Negative statistical bounds obtained for some variables do not represent actual negative values in the dataset; they are mathematical results of the IQR method.\n",
    "* Identifying an outlier does not necessarily mean that the record is incorrect. Potential outliers should be analyzed in the context of business rules before deciding whether they require treatment.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 9. Business Rule Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "### 9.1 Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "Verify that quantitative attributes comply with the expected constraints based on their meaning within the data model.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 9.2 Evaluated Rules\n",
    "\n",
    "| Table         | Attribute           | Rule            |\n",
    "| ------------- | ------------------- | --------------- |\n",
    "| `orders`      | `total_price`       | `>= 0`          |\n",
    "| `order_items` | `quantity`          | `>= 0`          |\n",
    "| `order_items` | `price_at_purchase` | `>= 0`          |\n",
    "| `products`    | `price`             | `>= 0`          |\n",
    "| `payments`    | `amount`            | `>= 0`          |\n",
    "| `reviews`     | `rating`            | Between 1 and 5 |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 9.3 Code"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4ef528e3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "business_rules = [\n",
    "    (\"orders\", \"total_price\", \">= 0\"),\n",
    "    (\"order_items\", \"quantity\", \">= 0\"),\n",
    "    (\"order_items\", \"price_at_purchase\", \">= 0\"),\n",
    "    (\"products\", \"price\", \">= 0\"),\n",
    "    (\"payments\", \"amount\", \">= 0\"),\n",
    "    (\"reviews\", \"rating\", \"between 1 and 5\")\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "business_validation = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for table_name, column, rule in business_rules:\n",
    "\n",
    "    series = tables[table_name][column]\n",
    "\n",
    "    if rule == \">= 0\":\n",
    "        invalid_records = (series < 0).sum()\n",
    "\n",
    "    elif rule == \"between 1 and 5\":\n",
    "        invalid_records = ((series < 1) | (series > 5)).sum()\n",
    "\n",
    "    business_validation.append({\n",
    "        \"table\": table_name,\n",
    "        \"column\": column,\n",
    "        \"rule\": rule,\n",
    "        \"invalid_records\": invalid_records,\n",
    "        \"valid\": invalid_records == 0\n",
    "    })\n",
    "\n",
    "business_validation_df = pd.DataFrame(business_validation)"
   ]
  },
