    "## 12. Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective:** Identify the number of orders and total spending for each customer.\n",
    "\n",
    "The query joins the `customers` and `orders` tables using `customer_id`. A `LEFT JOIN` is used to retain all customers, including those who do not have any orders.\n",
    "\n",
    "* `COUNT()` calculates the number of orders.\n",
    "* `SUM()` calculates total spending.\n",
    "* `COALESCE()` replaces `NULL` values with `0`.\n",
    "* `GROUP BY` groups the information by customer.\n",
    "* `ORDER BY` sorts customers from highest to lowest total spending.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Result:** A summary of each customer's purchasing behavior is obtained.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 12.1 Highest-Spending Customers\n",
    "\n",
    "The three customers with the highest recorded spending have only two orders each. However, their accumulated spending exceeds $17,000.\n",
    "\n",
    "This indicates that high total spending is not necessarily associated with a higher number of orders. To determine which factors explain these amounts, it would be necessary to further analyze the value and composition of the products included in their orders.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Top 3 Customers by Total Spending:**\n",
    "\n",
    "1. John Williams — 2 orders — $19,651.70\n",
    "2. James Natalie — 2 orders — $17,567.00\n",
    "3. John Philip — 2 orders — $17,124.03\n",
    "\n",
    "### 12.2 Customer Segmentation\n",
    "\n",
    "Of the 10,000 customers analyzed, 4,255 (42.55%) belong to the Low segment, 3,850 (38.50%) to the Medium segment, and 1,895 (18.95%) to the High segment.\n",
    "\n",
    "A total of 81.05% of customers are concentrated in the Low and Medium segments, while the High segment represents 18.95% of the total customer base.\n",
    "\n",
    "This distribution can be useful for identifying segmentation opportunities and for further analyzing which order characteristics are associated with higher spending.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Distribution:**\n",
    "\n",
    "* Low: 4,255 customers (42.55%)\n",
    "* Medium: 3,850 customers (38.50%)\n",
    "* High: 1,895 customers (18.95%)"
   ]
