    "### 12.3 Highest-Revenue Products\n",
    "\n",
    "The product with the highest recorded revenue is `Water Bottle`, belonging to the `Home & Kitchen` category, with $63,822.93 in revenue generated from 92 units sold.\n",
    "\n",
    "When comparing units sold and revenue, it can be observed that the product with the highest number of units sold within the Top 10 is not necessarily the product generating the highest revenue. For example, `Wireless Mouse` recorded 118 units sold and $53,935.18 in revenue, while `Water Bottle` generated $63,822.93 from 92 units sold.\n",
    "\n",
    "Three different records were also identified with the name `Standing Desk` (`product_id` 1186, 936, and 986). This demonstrates the importance of using `product_id` as a unique identifier to distinguish products and avoid grouping records solely by product name."
   ]
